# # /materica/
#
# Permanent identifiers for OpenMaterica, an open material schema and Python
# toolkit for the physical properties of substances in and around the human
# body. Source: https://github.com/Microrobotics-Simulation-Framework/OpenMaterica
#
# https://w3id.org/materica/ and everything under it redirects to
# https://openmaterica.org/, keeping the path.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by the OpenMaterica maintainers:
#
# nicholas.ehsan.roy@gmail.com
# GitHub username: NicholasEhsanRoy

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://openmaterica.org/$1 [R=302,L]
